npc_customer_1: Hello! Can you scan these instant noodles? Late night cravings are the best.
player: Coming right up.
npc_customer_1: Oh, and just a tip: if you hear someone whispering your name from the shadows tonight, don't look back.
npc_customer_1: It's the month of the wandering spirits! Just kidding... or am I?
player: That's... not very funny.
